🧩 1️⃣ TEMPLATE STRUCTURE CONCEPTS

You can think of each template as a composition layer system —
each layer is a media type, and templates define where and how they appear.

Layers you’ll handle:
Layer	Function
🎵 Music Layer	Background sound or short tune (looped or fade-in/out).
🖼️ Image Layer	Background or accent image(s). Can be AI-generated or user-uploaded.
📝 Text Layer	Message text, poem, wish, or quote. Can animate in.
🎤 Voice Layer	Optional voice message or cloned voice audio.
🎬 Video Layer	Optional background or foreground animation.
✨ Effects Layer	Confetti, sparkles, or animated stickers.



